@k.words.hypothesis.noun.2 k.words.sense word=hypothesis pos=noun n=2 supersense=noun.cognition gloss="a tentative insight into the natural world; a concept that is not yet verified but that if true would explain certain facts or phenomena" synonym=possibility synonym=theory is_a=concept part_of=theory core.source="wordnet 3.1"
